Now your application has 3 URLs :-
http://localhost:5173/
http://localhost:5173/about
http://localhost:5173/contact

[Flow]
Suppose you click :- About
The flow is :-
User clicks About
        ↓
<Link to="/about">
        ↓
URL changes to /about
        ↓
<Routes> checks the routes
        ↓
Finds:
<Route path="/about" element={<About />} />
        ↓
About component loads
        ↓
<h1>About Page</h1>
